  "pr_title": "GameEngine: migrate benchmark schema for ACP runtime lanes",
  "pr_body": "## Summary\n\n- add benchmark schema v4 with Raw Model, Agent Harness, and Coding Agent runtime identities\n- preserve schema v1-v3 records as legacy-harness evidence without reinterpretation\n- add ACP-aware runtime, harness, adapter, tool-contract, permission, and telemetry boundaries\n- extend campaign schema v3 with frozen agent-inclusive runtime identity and model-only comparison guards\n- keep ACP-unobservable model turns and token counts explicitly unavailable\n\n## Validation\n\nThis is a parallel authoring subtask. Heavy cargo, Windows, and Visual Validation are intentionally deferred to final integration. Canonical request build/preflight remains required."
